      "raw": "## Duplication Check",
      "kind": "heading",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "Duplication Check",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "lines": [
        31,
        31
      ],
      "raw": "PaymentId should be used as your main duplication check, as there are times where the EventId could change or in the event of a failed payment the TransactionId would be empty. This is important particularly if a webhook has failed and needs to be resent.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "PaymentId should be used as your main duplication check, as there are times where the EventId could change or in the event of a failed payment the TransactionId would be empty. This is important particularly if a webhook has failed and needs to be resent.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
